# Employee Management System

A Flask web app where an admin can manage employee records, built with Python, Flask and SQLite.

## Features
- Secure admin login (passwords are stored as hashes, never as plain text)
- First-time setup page to create the admin account
- Add, search, update and delete employee records
- Dashboard showing total employees, average salary and department-wise counts

## Built with
Python, Flask, SQLite, HTML, CSS

## Run it on your computer
```
pip install -r requirements.txt
python app.py
```
Open http://127.0.0.1:5000 in your browser. On the first visit you will be asked to create the admin account.

## Project structure
- `app.py` - the whole backend: database, login and pages
- `templates/` - the HTML pages
- `static/style.css` - the styling
